flowchart TD
    Start([User opens My Collection]) --> Check{Has banned/restricted cards?}
    Check -->|No| NoBanner[No banner shown]
    Check -->|Yes| ShowBanner[BanAlertBanner displayed]
    ShowBanner --> UserAction{User action}
    UserAction -->|Clicks link| Navigate[Navigate to /banlist?owned=1]
    Navigate --> ViewDetails[See banned cards with format details]
    UserAction -->|Clicks dismiss| Dismiss[Banner hidden]
